        "name": "USN-9109-1",
        "description": "It was discovered that Apache::Session::Browseable did not verify the certificates of remote LDAP servers by default. A remote attacker could possibly use this issue to perform a machine-in-the-middle attack and obtain sensitive information. This update enables certificate verification by default and adds the ldapVerify, ldapCAFile, and ldapCAPath options.",
        "aliases": [
          "CVE-2020-36659"
        ]
      },
